TELETEXT NAVIGATOR 1.5 (Win x64)
Retro internet client of The Teletext:
RIPscrip, NABU, Videotex (Minitel and
NAPLPS), Web 1.0, Gopher, ARPANET mail,
WAIS, Archie, FTP, Newsgroups, IRC,
CU-SeeMe TV, Telnet with Zmodem, GW-BASIC.
http://www.teletext.ca
Free software, AGPLv3.
Source: github.com/TheTeletext/Navigator
